//
// The Mapbox access token bundled with this build. Get a public token
// (starts with "pk.") at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/ — public
// tokens are meant to be embedded client-side, so committing a real one
// here isn't a secrecy problem the way an API secret would be, but this
// file is still gitignored (see app/.gitignore) since the token is tied to
// whoever's Mapbox account is paying for usage.
//
// Copy this file to mapbox_token.dart (drop the .example) and paste a real
// token below. Leaving it blank is fine — the Map tab falls back to
// OpenStreetMap (packages/../map/osm_map_view.dart) whenever this is empty,
// so a fresh checkout without a token still works, just without Mapbox's
// globe projection.

const mapboxAccessToken = '';
